      "text": "%spark\n// in Scala\ndef indexedFunc(partitionIndex:Int, withinPartIterator: Iterator[String]) = {\n      withinPartIterator.map(\n      value => s\"Partition: $partitionIndex => $value\")\n}\n\nwords.mapPartitionsWithIndex(indexedFunc).collect()",
