    },
    {
      "text": "#####foreachPartition\n*Although mapPartitions needs a return value to work properly, this next function does not.\nforeachPartition simply iterates over all the partitions of the data. The difference is that the\nfunction has no return value. This makes it great for doing something with each partition like\nwriting it out to a database*",
      "config": {
        "colWidth": 12,
        "fontSize": 9,
        "enabled": true,
        "editorMode": "ace/mode/markdown",
        "editorSetting": {
          "params": {},
          "forms": {},
          "language": "markdown",
          "editOnDblClick": false,
          "completionKey": "TAB",
          "completionSupport": true
        }
      },
      "settings": {
        "params": {},
        "forms": {}
      },
      "id": "bc8f857de0ca4dacbc4e1"
    },
    {
