    },
    {
      "text": "**each RDD is characterized by five main properties:**\n1. A list of partitions\n2. A function for computing each split\n3. A list of dependencies on other RDDs\n4. Optionally, a Partitioner for key-value RDDs (e.g., to say that the RDD is hashpartitioned)\n5. Optionally, a list of preferred locations on which to compute each split (e.g., block\nlocations for a Hadoop Distributed File System [HDFS] fil",
      "config": {
        "colWidth": 12,
        "fontSize": 9,
        "enabled": true,
        "editorMode": "ace/mode/markdown",
        "editorSetting": {
          "params": {},
          "forms": {},
