      "text": "%spark\ncase class Records(a:String,b:String)\n\nobject DataParser extends Serializable{\n  def parse(row:String):Records = Records(row.substring(0,1),row.substring(1,2))\n}\n\n\nval d = recordsByLenghtThree.map(x => DataParser.parse(x.head))\n",
