      "text": "%spark\nimport scala.collection.mutable.ListBuffer\n\ndef fetchIfS(row:Iterator[String]):Iterator[(Char,String)]={\n\n   val output:ListBuffer[(Char,String)] = ListBuffer.empty[(Char, String)]\n\n  //  row.map(row => (row(0),row))\n  //or\n  while(row.hasNext){\n    var currentRow= row.next\n    output.append((currentRow(0),currentRow))\n  }\n  output.toIterator\n}\n\nval pairRdd = words.mapPartitions(fetchIfS)\n\npairRdd.collect",
      "config": {
        "colWidth": 12,
        "fontSize": 9,
        "enabled": true,
        "editorMode": "ace/mode/scala",
